mber/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T04:14:12-08:00","id":332909,"title":"","content":"Val grinds his teeth, his face a strange mix of emotions.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah, looks like everything's fine...Come on wolf girl, let's do the memsahib's bidding.&quot;<br /> <br /> He bows towards Hannah, then shoots Jon a grin.<br /> <br /> &quot;And you can come too Barbie.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3869,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","user":"Al-Haleem","date":". 12-07-2014, 07:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T07:57:39-08:00","id":332961,"title":"","content":"&quot;Go wolf,&quot; was all that Echo would reply, her eyes lingering on Val for a few brief moments before she cut in between the two layabouts - Scott &amp; Jon - and nipped at their shoulders.<br /> <br /> And then, without waiting for their response, she slipped into the shadows, weaving through the pines towards their quarry.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.