 up from his lounging position, padding slowly with tail tucked in Echoes' direction. He crouched low, slinking into his own stealthy movements.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Dexterity + Stealth<br /> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4734425/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4734425/</a> (10, 7, 6, 1)<br /> Oof.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T17:46:10-08:00","id":333591,"title":"","content":"Hannah nodded at Stir as the Theurge prodded Jon and Val along. She watched the wolves retreat into the shadows for a moment, wrapping her arms around herself to suppress a shiver, &quot;alright then, Geoff, Scott; let's go see what this guy has to say,&quot; She began to trudge toward the cigarette glow, forcing her boots to land a little harder than necessary hoping to draw attention away from her sneaking packmates.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Charisma + Subterfuge for drawing attention. I thought maybe performance, but I'm also trying to help the pack hide. The roll ended up at 0 successes either way I'm guessing <b>Die roll for Hannah Dawnstar</b><br /><br /> Rolled on: Dec. 7, 2014, 6:08 p.m.<br /> 5d10 \u2192 [7,1,4,3,2] = (17)<br /> <br /> [<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4734729/\" target=\"_blank\">link to roll</a>] [<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/search/1528729\" target=\"_blank\">link to character</a>]<br /> <b>Formatted Versions</b><br /><br /> Link <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4734729/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4734729/</a> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-07T19:02:35-08:00","id":333670,"title":"","content":"Geoff understood what Hannah was trying to do, and followed her, sniffing and coughing as if he had a bad cold. He put his hands into its pockets to keep them warm, and hurried along Hannah, wanting to get this done quickly.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I'm using Wits + Subterfuge for this.<br /> <span style=\"color:#EDEECB\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">4d10</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#A0CFBE\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> \u2192 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#A0A0A0\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">[4,1,8,2] = (15) </span></span></span>http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4734765/ </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T01:19:59-08:00","id":333894,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Wow, I guess you guys are just not good at drawing attention to yourselves. Good to know. :-P<br /> <br /> That aside, I need clarification- are Scott and Val going with Hannah and Echoes, respectively, as Hannah said, or are they hanging back?<br /> <br /> Also, when you reply, make sure you guys specify how far from the man Hannah and Geoff stop.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> As Hannah and Geoff start loudly tromping towards the man, they cross the distance quickly. As they come into sight of each other, he is facing them, smiling, taking another drag from his black cigarette. The smell of burning cloves becomes noticeable in the air every time he exhales. This is perhaps fortunate, as when Stir of Echoes begins to sneak closer, she gets a whiff of the clothes the man is wearing... from the smell, it's unlikely they've ever been washed. Well, that may not be entirely true. The mildew smell mixed in with the other smells makes it clear the clothes have at least been wet at some point; however, soap is obviously foreign to them. The others can smell only the scent of the clove cigarette.<br /> <br /> The man does not look in the direction of Stir of Echoes and Jon, instead focusing the homids approaching him. He smiles, showing a mouthful of slightly yellow teeth, takes another draw from his cigarette, and waits, saying nothing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T03:49:12-08:00","id":334077,"title":"","content":"Scott gets the idea and moves a bit closer, but he's a bit of a stranger to stealth operations and continues to hang back in wolf-form. He follows a bit of a distance behind Echoes as she approaches.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T10:33:50-08:00","id":334334,"title":"","content":"&quot;Go wolf? Yeah right.&quot;<br /> <br /> Val lets out a hiss of breath, dropping into a crouch. Slowly, he prowls after Jon and Echoes, eyes forever flicking towards the cigarette's faint light. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Dex+Sneak...<br /> 4d10 \u2192 [5,2,1,6] = (14) <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4735203/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4735203/</a><br /> Yikes...Either I did something wrong, or that's a terrible roll : P</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T19:02:52-08:00","id":334727,"title":"","content":"Hannah rolled her eyes at Val as he departed, and after what she thought was loud heavy footfalls she arrived at the smiling extremely unkempt man. She stopped about 10 good paces from him, still half crossing her arms, half hugging herself to keep out the cold. She shot a glance at Geoff just to double check he was there before speaking, &quot;Hello, what brings you to this neck of the woods?&quot; she asks, squaring the yellow toothed man in her gaze.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T20:29:26-08:00","id":334785,"title":"","content":"Geoff sighed at Val's departure, and followed the Silver Fangs. Still shivering and coughing, he arrived near the man, stopping also at 10 paces. He smiled and nodded to greet him, trying to appear friendly. &quot;And on New year's Eve, no less. It's so freaking cold tonight!&quot; he added to Hannah's question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T11:37:37-08:00","id":339242,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Al-Haleem</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/321065-ic-rage-across-the-delaware-valley-werewolf-the-apocalypse?p=334334#post334334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yikes...Either I did something wrong, or that's a terrible roll : P</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup, that's a terrible roll. Luckily, with the snow on the ground muffling everyone's footsteps, and the man distracted by the approach of Hannah and Geoff, the difficulty was only six. So, it's a simple failure, not a botch.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The disheveled man smiles at Hannah and Geoff as they approach and opens his mouth to respond... only to hesitate, blinking confusedly at the sound of heavy footfalls and snapping twigs. He turns, raising an eyebrow and looking in the direction of Val, Jon and Stir of Echoes. With a small chuckle, he looks back to Hannah and Geoff. &quot;Your friends are kind of loud. Why don't you have them come out, so I can talk to all of you at once?&quot;<br /> <br /> He takes another draw from his black clove cigarette, holding the smoke in for a moment before exhaling. &quot;I've been waiting for the six of you. And yes, it is freaking cold. Especially without fur! These 'clothes' aren't really an acceptable substitute,&quot; he comments, picking at his sleeve with his free hand and shaking his head. &quot;And they're so hard to get clean! But if you try to walk around without them, you either freeze worse, or get thrown in jail. It's crazy!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T14:48:05-08:00","id":339468,"title":"","content":"Geoff kept his grin, trying to put the man (or rather the Garou) at ease. &quot;Yeah, most of them are shy. I guess we'll just have to talk louder then! &quot; He chuckled, before shivering a bit. &quot;You know, since we're all very cold right now, why don't you tell us what do you want? The sooner we get this done, the sooner we get back to our respective fur!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T18:00:14-08:00","id":339598,"title":"","content":"Hannah tried not to scowl, but failed, her gaze falling past the man to where she assumed the others had failed at being stealthy. She sighed, then shouted, &quot;come on out guys, there's no point in hiding!&quot; Her voice dropped to a normal, but irritated, tone that was interrupted by a momentary chatter as a shiver ran through her, &quot;you two have a point, it is cold,&quot; she offered to Geoff and the stranger. She hugged herself with her arms, and and eyed the stranger with a look that said <i>well out with it then.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T20:38:40-08:00","id":339707,"title":"","content":"With every crack and thump, Echo cringed, posture slumping when the man looked their way. Someone had given them away. She craned her head back, seeking the culprit, and when her eyes landed on Val, dragging along in Homid, no less, her expression flipped from disbelief, disgust, and then to <i>rage</i>.<br /> <br /> Her lips curled back in a silent snarl, body bristling as she sidestepped Jon and made straight for the ragabash, teeth ready to wrap around his throat, to<i> punish.</i><br /> <br /> But then Hannah's call rang out, and Echo hesitated midstride, swerving her charge to meet their summons. When she crept up beside the pair, she looked almost relaxed. Almost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-14T03:30:08-08:00","id":339915,"title":"","content":"Val stares after Echoes for a moment, before dropping into a crouch beside Jon. <br /> <br /> &quot;Did you see that?&quot; he hisses. &quot;That crazy bitch tried to go for my throat! Please tell me you saw that.&quot;<br /> <br /> Leaning close, he lays a hand on Jon's scruff. &quot;I think we should watch her...I've heard things about Red Talons, they're all nuts y'know, don't believe what anyone else says. A friend of mine, he...&quot;<br /> <br /> Val takes a sharp breath. &quot;Anyway, just keep an eye on her, or failing that, keep an eye on <i>me</i>!&quot;<br /> <br /> He lets his touch linger for a moment before standing straight, sighing deeply.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-14T03:40:01-08:00","id":339927,"title":"","content":"Jon, still a wolf, leaped back an inch or two when brushed aside by Echoes. Upon finding himself a shield between Val and the lupus, his ears splayed in confusion. At Val's proclamation, Jon did his best to remain composed, all while lifting a paw and pointing it at the homid Hannah.<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't as me to do that. We have a leader in charge of that.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jon trotted out of the treeline to join the others, sitting on his hind legs. It was too much effort to shift back right now. Besides, he didn't need to do any talking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-14T04:03:37-08:00","id":339929,"title":"","content":"&quot;Leader.&quot; Val scoffs. &quot;I wonder if he was right about everything?&quot;<br /> <br /> He begins to trace a shape on his chest, then stops, shakes his head and goes stomping after Jon, making as much noise as possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-18T17:45:50-08:00","id":344275,"title":"","content":"The man seems unaffected by Hannah's imperious tone, taking another drag from his black cigarette. &quot;Man, I love these things. I mean, I know they're just dried up leaves, but they taste so good.&quot; He holds it under his nose again for a moment, inhaling the aroma of the cloves. &quot;Smells nice, too. There's something about these things that makes me want to keep smoking them, besides the nice smell. Almost like my body needs them. And if my body needs them, then they must be good for it, right?&quot; He nods firmly at his own logic as the stragglers start coming into view.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, anyway, enough of that,&quot; he says, finishing his clove cigarette. Instead of flicking the butt away, he points it down and twists with his fingers until the remaining tobacco falls out, the lit tip going out as it lands in the snow. He slides the remains of black paper and filter into a pocket. &quot;I didn't come out here to talk about cigarettes, or any other human things.&quot; He shakes his head firmly. &quot;No, I certainly did not. I'm here to talk about your mission.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;My name is Nose-to-the-sidewalk, and I'm a Bone Gnawer.&quot; He nods to Echoes as she approaches. &quot;Your mentor, Sunset Howl, might have mentioned me, Stir of Echoes. We're packmates, you see.&quot; He turns back to addressing everyone. &quot;Now, this place you're going, the Piney Sept... it's our place. Bone Gnawer, through and through. Well, except for the Croatany bits. But the rest? All Bone Gnawer. We don't have a lot of places to call our own, you see, and this one has been ours for a long time. It's special to us. I've been working real hard to make the place liveable again for the past few years.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What I'm trying to say is, when you have to fight whatever it is you're going there to fight, try not to totally wreck the place, all right? It'd be nice if I could make it liv eable again sometime before the Apocalypse, y'know?&quot;<br /> <br /> As he speaks, he reaches into a pocket and pulls out a packet of Tastycake Butterscotch Krimpets. The sound of tearing cellophane fills the woods. &quot;Mmm,&quot; he says taking a bite out of one. &quot;I love theshe thingsh,&quot; he mumbles as he chews the cake, small crumbs spitting from his mouth as he talks. &quot;Anyway, try eshpeshially to avoi' the shemetary. The gravesh? I jusht...&quot; he swallows the cake. &quot;Mmm, that's tasty. I just cleaned and cleansed that place real good. Some of those graves go back to the Croatan days. It's extra sacred, so try not to disturb it. Oh, also, if you go into the Umbra, you might see a raccoon spirit. Raccoon was the caern totem before the place fell, and this raccoon spirit has been helping me cleanse the place. He's very friendly.&quot;<br /> <br /> He stuffs the second krimpet into his mouth whole. &quot;You guysh got all that shtuff?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T02:30:11-08:00","id":344507,"title":"","content":"Val cocks an eyebrow. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh really.&quot; He steps close, scrutinizing Nose's face. &quot;If you've been 'cleansing' this place so well, why are we being sent to perform a rite to do the exact same thing, unless...&quot;<br /> <br /> He puts his hands on his hips. &quot;You're all quite capable of doing it, aren't you? This is part of some tedious initiation. Why did no one mention you by the way? The elders implied the Sept is abandoned.&quot; <br /> <br /> He smirks. &quot;Not that I have much faith in the elders.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T03:09:47-08:00","id":344534,"title":"","content":"Jon blinked when Val stepped forward. He visibly winced at the Ragabash's challenge, then barked angrily.<br /> <br /> &quot;Shut. Up.&quot;<br /> <br /> Jon crouched low and began the transformation back to his original form. When he was on two legs again, John inhaled deeply, &quot;Whether or not it's an <i>initiation</i>, it's still freaking vital.&quot; His brow furrowed so deeply it threatened to metaphorically cave his own skull in. &quot;I mean, I'm sorry. You may not trust the elders, but did they not tell you what happened around here? I dunno about you, but I sure as hell don't want anything potentially <i>worse</i> happening here! Even if it's practice, it's practice that will do us some<i> fucking good</i>.&quot;<br /> <br /> The novice Shadow Lord turned to Nose, &quot;Sorry, sorry. Look, yeah, we're new...&quot; He quickly shifted the subject, &quot;I'm Jon. Uh, Galliard. Yeah. Oh, hey, what flavor is that?&quot; Jon gestured to the snack cake, &quot;Have you tried this strawberry chee...&quot; At that moment, the Lord cliath patted his rematerialized jacket, remembering that unlike clothes, junk food does not come with you. He then pointed a finger, &quot;If you haven't tried Raspberry Zingers, you absolutely must. I'll pick you up some next time I get a chance. If I get a chance.&quot;<br /> <br /> Without consulting the leader of the pack, he goes on, &quot;Anything we should know? It would be awesome.&quot; He hooked a thumb over his shoulder, grinning slyly, &quot;Maybe she'll go in for a crate of those cigarettes for you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T03:42:53-08:00","id":344543,"title":"","content":"Val smiles thinly. &quot;So willing to trust, so willing to <i>obey</i>. Just like Sita. And we all know how <i>that </i>story ends. Perhaps you should let him answer my questions before you lick his boots.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T04:15:39-08:00","id":344555,"title":"","content":"Geoff sighed at the bickering, and headed toward the Ragabash with a smile, putting a friendly hand on his shoulder. &quot;Val, can I talk to you in private?&quot; It wasn't so much a question, as a strong suggestion.&quot;The group will catch us up later.&quot; In fact, the Philodox was already moving away from the group and back into the forest, stopping at around twenty yards from the rest of the pack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":2016,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","user":"Evilmarmelade","date":". 12-19-2014, 07:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T08:41:38-08:00","id":344823,"title":"","content":"Val follows Geoff away from the rest of the pack before opening his mouth.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah Geoff.&quot; Val smiles broadly. &quot;Is this when you confess your undying love? Sudden, but I can hardly blame you.&quot; <br /> His smile vanishes. &quot;Or are you going to tell me to play nice with the other puppies?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3869,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","user":"Al-Haleem","date":". 12-19-2014, 03:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T09:29:35-08:00","id":344853,"title":"","content":"She perked up at the mention of her mentor and the talk of spirits, only to slip back into a solemn glare as the bickering commenced, her expression growing dark.<br /> <br /> When the pair walked off, she wrinkled her nose in distaste, and looked to the two packmates that remained. Two. Her eyes widened.<br /> <br /> &quot;Forgive me,&quot; she was watching the Elder now, avoiding direct eye contact. &quot;Someone is missing.&quot;<br /> <br /> And with that, Echo was off, tracking back the way they had come until she had found Scott. &quot;Come,&quot; she sniffed at the Stargazer, concerned. &quot;The pack needs you.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":3804,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","user":"Stir of Echoes","date":". 12-19-2014, 10:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T10:17:11-08:00","id":344887,"title":"","content":"Geoff smiled and nodded, playing along. &quot;Guess there's no point hiding it! I am indeed in love with you, a random guy I just met an hour ago.&quot; He burst into a chuckle that died into a sigh. Putting his hands into his pockets, he spoke in calm tone.&quot;In all seriousness, Val. What's going on? You seem to consider that we're all against you, and you make a point of antagonizing us.&quot; The Philodox cocked his head. &quot;Do you have a problem? We can talk about it if you want.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":2016,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","user":"Evilmarmelade","date":". 12-19-2014, 05:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T10:28:16-08:00","id":344899,"title":"","content":"Val folds his arms, but manages a smile. &quot;Alright, you look like you have a modicum of intelligence, so I'll be honest. I'm here under duress. Oh Sunchaser can mask it in all the platitudes she likes, but I know when I'm being had. I'm not a fan of the cultic eco-terrorist bullshit either.&quot;<br /> <br /> He leans in close, voice a hiss. &quot;Besides, the thrill of rebellion is too tempting to resist, you should try it sometime&quot;<br /> <br /> Still smiling, he brushes snow off Geoff's shoulder. &quot;I think you and I are going to be friends.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3869,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","user":"Al-Haleem","date":". 12-20-2014, 04:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-19T18:16:20-08:00","id":345287,"title":"","content":"Hannah watched the entire scene unfold, hands still wrapped around herself trying to keep out the cold. As Val began to berate Nose, she scrunched her face up in disgust, and began to take a few steps towards him, until Jon stepped up. She waited and watched clearly contemplating, and as Jon as Geoff and Val walked away she shot Jon and thankful nod but added, &quot;He's a Ragabash,&quot; she finally says, &quot;Val is suppose to question how we're doing things, perhaps he's bit brash, but he did his job.&quot;<br /> <br /> She scanned the scene once more before fixing her attention on the dirty Garou in front of them, &quot;I'm Hannah Dawnstar,&quot; she instinctively offered a half curtsy, but her tone was annoyed as she continued, &quot;I appreciate your concern, and your wisdom Nose-to-the-Sidewalk. I assure you my pack will offer the utmost of respect to the Caern. However we are suppose to be unaided in the task ahead. So while I have noted, and sincerely appreciate your advice, please do not interfere with our rite.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-20T04:49:12-08:00","id":345676,"title":"","content":"Geoff nodded emphatically. &quot;Listen. I'm not going to pretend that I understand you. I barely know you, I don't know anything about your story or Sunchaser either, but we can talk about it later if you want to. And you're correct, you absolutely have the right to make yourself heard.&quot;<br /> He looked around, to check if the rest of the pack was far enough. &quot;But rebelling for the sake of rebelling is pointless. If you want your message to be relevant, you really shouldn't antagonize people, otherwise, they'll never listen to you. Honestly, right now, you sound more like a whiny teenager, and I know that you're more than that.&quot;<br /> <br /> Like a conspirator, he lowered his voice. &quot;And between us? I'm not happy too with the way things are going with the pack. Despite what she's saying, Hannah's certainly not my leader, and Echoes sure as hell need to chill out.&quot; A wry smile crept on his face as he leaned back. &quot;But you know what? I'll play along for now. Because we have a mission, and because it's fucking cold out there, and I don't want to spend all my night arguing with the others. If we complete this rite, we'll be full garou, which means that we won't be treated as kids anymore, but as adults, with way more freedom.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":2016,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","user":"Evilmarmelade","date":". 12-23-2014, 05:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-21T06:36:04-08:00","id":346602,"title":"","content":"Scott, who has been meditating in lupus shape, blocking out the feel of the snow and the cold, has peacefully connected with the spirits of the universe when Echoes comes and calls for him. He opens his eyes, not moving the rest of his body, and then stands up and goes by her side. He brushes up against her as he walks, leaning into her slightly to let her know he's just been cold and conserving energy. While a homid and certainly no natural in his lupus form, Scott does seem to at least understand a wolf's body language enough to convey it to his packmate. He lets her lead the way back to the group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-21T18:52:40-08:00","id":347092,"title":"","content":"Nose-to-the-Sidewalk watches, a bemused smile on his face, as Geoff leads Jon off. He turns back to Hannah and Jon, still smiling. &quot;Well, as your new packmate pointed out, yes, we are perfectly capable of investigating and dealing with whatever is causing the problem ourselves. But then how would you ever learn? We all have to go through our rite of passage. And don't worry, Dawnstar. I have no intention of interfering. I just wanted to make sure you and yours had all the facts.&quot;<br /> <br /> He looks to the side as Echoes and Scott return to the rest of the pack. &quot;Ah, so you are all here. I was worried you might have split up or something. Well, I've said my piece,&quot; he concludes, shaking another cigarette out of his pack, which reads &quot;Djarum Black.&quot; He raises it up to his mouth, fishing around in his pockets. &quot;Best of luck to you guys then. We're all behind you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-22T09:02:41-08:00","id":347468,"title":"","content":"Val flashes Geoff a brilliant smile. &quot;Finally, someone with a bit of bloody sense. Okay, Geoff, I'll keep quiet...for now. I'm normally not <i>quite </i>so truculent, but between Princess Dawnstar, psycho wolfgirl and Barbie boy, I just can't be having with this shit, and I'm not gonna take it lying down. As soon I'm done here...well, we'll see.&quot;<br /> <br /> He turns away. &quot;Come on, let's rejoin Gaia's good little minions before they rip our throats out.&quot;<br /> <br /> Pausing, he glances over his shoulder and winks. &quot;And we'll definitely be talking later. Somewhere with heating.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-22T14:15:15-08:00","id":347666,"title":"","content":"&quot;Glad that you understand me.&quot; Geoff smiled back. &quot;It's kinda my job as a mediator, so if you ever feel down, or even if you want to vent your frustration on someone, I'm here, alright?&quot; He patted him on the back. &quot;Let's head back, and prove them that you're not all just talk;&quot; He said, walking toward the pack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-22T18:31:56-08:00","id":347926,"title":"","content":"Some part of her softened, and a relaxed smile came to her lips, &quot;thank you,&quot; she managed with a more genuine tone than before. She nodded in deference to Nose, before her attention snapped towards Geoff and Val as they approached the group again, &quot;nice of you to join us,&quot; the wine was back in her voice. Her hands, which she had been using to block the cold, went to her hips, &quot;what's with the secret meeting?&quot; She leered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-22T21:23:24-08:00","id":347984,"title":"","content":"Scott does not seem to approve of them going off by themselves either. He walks next to Hannah, and sits on his haunches. &quot;A single missing plank can cause a whole raft to sink,&quot; he states to them. &quot;Think not of our short time together in the present, but connect to our bonds between each other in the future. And please, repeat this mantra:&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;A family united under the Emerald Mother is whole.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> After speaking, Scott merely waits quietly for more instructions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-23T01:30:00-08:00","id":348120,"title":"","content":"Geoff blinked in surprise. &quot;You guys need to stop with the paranoia. I just took Val aside to calm things down, that's all.&quot; He raised a skeptical eyebrow to Scott's philosophical tirade. &quot;Yeah, well, thanks for the advice, but I know what I'm doing. I'm the Philodox here, and mediation and moral support are literally my day-time job.&quot;<br /> <br /> Turning toward the Bone Gnawer, he offered a slight apologetical nod. &quot;Sorry for that. Our pack was formed less than an hour ago, and we obviously have some things to work out.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T07:09:00-08:00","id":350641,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, I know how it is,&quot; he says distractedly, still fishing around in his pockets. &quot;You'll get used to each other,&quot; he absently affirms, finally pulling out a battered silver zippo lighter. He tries a couple of times to flick a spark from it, unsuccessfully. &quot;They can put a human on Luna, but they can't make working lighters,&quot; he grumbles under his breath until he finally gets a light. &quot;Well, I've taken enough of your time. Off you go. Try not to kill each other,&quot; he concludes, moving off as he finally gets his cigarette lit, walking back in the direction of the sept proper.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T08:19:11-08:00","id":350664,"title":"","content":"Val curls his lip. &quot;Thanks for the infinite cosmic wisdom Scott, I've got a mantra for you too. I'm freezing my ass off, and want to get this crap over with. Ommmm.&quot;<br /> <br /> He places a hand on his hip. &quot;Profound right? It's from Rig Veda. I'm also thrilled that no one questioned Nose as to why he considers an abandoned Sept Bone Gnawer territory, but what do I know? Shall we start walking? Geoff?&quot;<br /> <br /> Val motions Geoff over, inviting him to walk beside him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-26T18:32:14-08:00","id":351154,"title":"","content":"Hannah rolls her eyes at Val, but walks past him, &quot;perhaps what most people consider abandoned the Bone Gnawer's see home, that's how they work right?&quot; She sets her pace a little faster before falling forward onto all fours; bones popping, mass shifting, fur erupting until she was once again her sleek silver lupus form. She shot a glance back at the others, then set off at a trot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T04:56:37-08:00","id":351531,"title":"","content":"Geoff closed his eyes and shook his head. &quot;This can only end well...&quot; he muttered. &quot;Val, let's go as wolf. It'll be faster and you'll be warmer.&quot; The Philodox stretched for a bit before shifting into his brown wolf form. He started to follow Hannah, but decided to stop and wait for the others, not wanting to let anyone behind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T08:57:25-08:00","id":351701,"title":"","content":"Scott was a white skinned, blue eyed, blonde haired average American boy. He stayed around quiet and didn't really say much of anything, but when he opens his mouth he only spoke strangely. But Val's response to him seems to reveal a new side of him. It doesn't cause anything to snap, and does not bring about any anger in his stance or posture, but the words show something else.<br /> <br /> As a wolf, he walks in front of Val and prevents him from moving past. No, he would not tolerate abuse day after day, night after night. Places would be decided now.<br /> <br /> &quot;Before one can walk they must learn how to stand. It now occurs to me that one of our own does not know where he stands, so moving forward will prove difficult,&quot; Scott says, tone sharp. &quot;Your words make your heart clear to me. You are amongst your family now, yet you speak as if you are not one of us. If that is the case, turn around and leave. I will look to protect my brothers and sisters with my life, and I do not need a wayward child who will not do the same for me.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;From here on, if you take one more step forward you may no longer claim to be forced on this path. And if you do, understand this: if you insult me again I will next teach you the story of the hungry wolf and the brainless chicken.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3789,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","user":"DeathmatchFM","date":". 12-27-2014, 12:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T10:24:41-08:00","id":351788,"title":"","content":"Jon's arms went limp and his eyes rolled over-dramatically. Adding to that artificial drama, Jon sighed quite audibly, &quot;Well, wolf it is...&quot;<br /> <br /> Jon dropped to the ground to assume the form. After settling onto all fours, he took off, making damn sure he stuck with the pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T20:42:07-08:00","id":352289,"title":"","content":"Hannah turned sharply around, glaring down everyone behind her, her form shifted upward, a growl raising from her maw as she twisted back into her human form. She didn't say anything...yet, but she watched with the intensity of a quiet storm, and her posture seemed ready to leap into action.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T23:50:35-08:00","id":352394,"title":"","content":"When Hanna turned around, Jon immediately assumed a pose in his lupus form. He lowered his head beneath the level of his shoulders. He tucked his tail and splayed his ears. His Garou tongue took a squeaky tone to it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Forgive me. I overstepped. I forgot that you knew everything about this place and where we need to go and what we should watch out for, beyond bad spirits. Again, forgive me...&quot;<br /> <br /> Jon dipped lower, forepaws stretching before him and chin nearly touching the ground. &quot;Please, let us continue in our tasks,&quot; Jon pleaded, then near inaudibly muttered, &quot;<i>blindly.&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T07:23:08-08:00","id":352636,"title":"","content":"Val stifles a laugh. &quot;Jon, who the hell are you talking to? And stop grovelling, it's making me cringe.&quot;<br /> <br /> Suppressing a smile, he turns towards Scott. &quot;As for you, entry-level Zen student, let's cut the crap. None of you are my relatives, you're not my brother, I barely bloody know you, so save the pseudo-mysticism.&quot; His eyes narrow, voice dropping to a growl. &quot; And don't pretend to know me, you have no idea what I've suffered, of what's led me to this place. If you were truly wise, perhaps you'd understand.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;And to preempt anything from you.&quot; He points at Hannah. &quot;Can we save the pissing match until after we're done with this asinine initiation? I'm cold, and tired, and I really don't want to fight.&quot;<br /> <br /> There is a rush of shape and colour, the popping and twisting of bone, and a scrawny grey wolf stands in Val's place.<br /> <br /> &quot;Magnificent aren't I? Worth the wait huh?&quot;<br /> <br /> His muzzle splits wide, and he licks Scott across his nose. Yipping, he slips around him, dashing to Geoff's side.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3869,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","user":"Al-Haleem","date":". 12-28-2014, 11:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T14:57:17-08:00","id":353161,"title":"","content":"Scott refuses to be licked and will avoid any of Val's attempts to do so. He also does NOT let Val move anywhere past him, and will move to intercept. <br /> <br /> &quot;No, we resolve this <i>now</i>. If you are not willing to see us as your family, then why come to join a pack? If you are so cold and tired, go home. You are here to observe ancient tradition, not to whine. Either you came here of your own decision to join a pack, or you did not. If you were merely forced here, then I will return you back power of your destiny: leave here and do not return. If your intention is merely to challenge and dishonor those meant to be closest to you, then you are useless to us.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T16:34:35-08:00","id":354180,"title":"","content":"If wolves could roll eyes and groan in exasperation, Geoff would have done so. Instead, he snorted and bared his teeth for a moment before going back to the group. &quot;This has GOT to stop now guys! We didn't even make it to the sept and we're already at each other's throats! Don't you realize how childish you all are right now?! This is not high school here! We're on a mission together, and we're going to finish it together!&quot; He said, pronouncing his last sentence directly to Scott. &quot;Bridge, I respect your believes, and I'm glad that we have the last Stargazer of America here with us, but I'm gonna be frank here : you're slightly delusional if you think that every Garou is thrilled to join our ranks. Val here was forced to, and you pushing him around is not helping. I mean...&quot; The Philodox trailed off before turning to the Ragabash. &quot;No offense, but you're really not the idea I have of a Get of Fenris. So either I'm mistaken and I'm sorry, or either you were drafted in this unwillingly.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyway, Bridge.&quot; He continued, taking a few steps toward him. &quot;Need I remind you what happens to Garous without packs? They're like candy for the Black Spirals. If you decide to banish him right now, your rejection will push him into isolation, and soon he'll find himself prey to the Wyrm. That's why we're the Garou <i>Nation</i>&quot;, he said, emphasing the last word. &quot;Because we may be all from different tribes, we may have different ideals, hell, we may be from different species,&quot; he added, his muzzle pointing at Echoes, &quot;but we need to be united if we want to fight back the Wyrm and its abominations. And turning onto each other isn't the way to do that, and neither is pushing around reluctant teenagers.&quot;<br /> <br /> He took a good look at each of them, hoping to catch their respective gazes. &quot;So please, guys. I'm not saying that we should all hold hands and sing Kumbaya, but can we, at least for tonight, keep our resentment to ourselves? We just have a few hours to go until we get to part ways, and maybe find different packs on our own. Who knows, maybe we'll grow to like each other, maybe not! But right now, it's not important : we have to be adult, to keep our cool, and to continue our mission. And this means doing this as a group of six werewolves. Can you all do that? Can we all cooperate tonight? Bridge, Echoes, Hannah, Jon, Val?&quot; It was clear that he expected an answer from each of them, looking at them when he mentionned their respective names.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T18:46:10-08:00","id":354250,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will not relent in this,&quot; Scott states. &quot;It is like the story of the butterfly that flies desperately in a rainstorm to keep its wings from getting wet. You make too many assumptions of what I say. I do not ask that Val step out of our pack to be alone. He could find others that he willingly accepts. I do not desire that he leave us entirely. I only desire to give <i>him </i>the power to choose his brothers and sisters. None of us benefit from one who does not believe he is one of us, and neither does he benefit from a life-decision thrust upon him by the elders.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You are quick to speak to him privately and then chastise me despite his obvious disrespect of myself and Echoes, but perhaps you need to inspect your own bias, whatever it may be. Just as a tree's bark does not only grow on one side, he need not be without a pack to fall victim to the Darkness, nor should he join with those he so obviously resents.&quot;<br /> <br /> As a wolf, Scott continues his prowl, isolating Val. &quot;It is as this one said, 'cold'. I will spare him the 'few hours' of his continued suffering and offer him now the choice to go off to find a pack of his own, but I'll not take another step on a path where I drag along an unwilling soul.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T19:14:45-08:00","id":354287,"title":"","content":"&quot;I spoke to him privately because I wanted to defuse the situation peacefully, and I would have done the same with any of you! Don't accuse me of favoriting him&quot;, Geoff answered with a snarl, getting increasingly annoyed. &quot;But fine! Since it seems that I can't even be trusted to do my job as a Philodox, since I'm suspicious because I preferred to speak with someone in private than to have this kind of exploding argument, I'll just shut up now and let Val answer. Oh and by the way Bridge. He has a name, and it's not &quot;this one.&quot;&quot;<br /> He sat in the snow, watching for the Get's reaction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T08:15:39-08:00","id":354731,"title":"","content":"Val rests upon his haunches and stares into the sky. Taking a deep breath, he begins to speak in a soft, quiet voice. <br /> <br /> \u201cOnce upon a time, in distant and significantly warmer India, there lived a cynical scholar. He was discussing the Goddess Saraswati with his friend, a Brahmin.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u2018How is it possible the Goddess can know all?\u2019 the scholar said. <br /> <br /> \u2018She is a goddess,\u2019 replied the Brahmin. \u2018Nothing is hidden from her sight.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018Yet how can you be sure?\u2019<br /> <br /> The Brahmin sighed heavily. \u2018Come to my temple, I shall call on the Goddess to answer any question you desire.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018So be it.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u201cThree days later, the scholar journeyed to the temple, carrying a simple black box. The Brahmin asked what it contained, but the scholar simply smiled. Shrugging, the Brahmin began his ritual, beseeching Saraswati to turn her gaze upon him.<br /> <br /> \u201cA rush of light, of colour. Before the men rose a radiant being, all flame and white stars.\u201d<br /> <br /> 'And why do you call upon me, pundit?' Intoned the Goddess, voice shaking the heavens.<br /> <br /> The Brahmin fell to his knees, trembling. 'Font of Wisdom, this man doubts your power, he cannot believe you are all-knowing.'<br /> <br /> 'Indeed?' The Goddess turned her fire upon the scholar. 'Ask, and I shall answer.'<br /> <br /> Unafraid, the scholar raised his box. 'Oh Goddess, tell me what this vessel contains, and I shall bow to you.'<br /> <br /> Saraswati laughed. 'A trick. The box is empty.'<br /> <br /> Now the scholar laughed. Removing the lid, he raised the container to the Goddess\u2019s face\u2026<br /> <br /> And her reflection stared back at her.<br /> <br /> For the scholar had affixed a mirror to the box\u2019s bottom. <br /> <br /> 'No, sweet lady,' said the scholar. 'This box is not empty, for it contains everything.' <br /> <br /> \u201cToo often do those who believe they know all refuse to look beneath the surface, it is easier to accept the expected, than to peer past the veil, into yourself.\u201d<br /> <br /> Val tears his gaze away from the sky, looks at \u2018Bridge, eyes lidded. <br /> <br /> \u201cYou see only the obvious. It is right or wrong, black or white, yes or no. Can I not love and hate you? Do you see only an empty box, or your own reflection? I did not choose to join you, but I can do nothing else. If you think I\u2019m empty, so be it, but whatever you believe, would you kindly get out of my way?\u201d<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T21:11:28-08:00","id":355432,"title":"","content":"Scott is either unamused or unimpressed. He listens to what Val says, but will not budge in the process.<br /> <br /> &quot;The color of an action is dependent upon a person's heart, but as a traveler moves towards his destination he can either run from his fate or meet it. You say you did not choose to join us but in this you are incorrect. I give you back now the power of your destiny so that you may make that decision. If you wish to accept this then I will move from your way and you may join with us, though you must abandon this stone you carry which is named Acrimony. Yet I will not permit you to pass so long as are unable to accept the consequences of your action or inaction.&quot;<br /> <br /> The blonde wolf looks around, though keeps a careful eye that Val does not get past him. &quot;This offer need not be unique to this one here,&quot; he states. &quot;It should go for all of us. If you do not desire to be there, if this is not your destiny, then do not walk this path which you did not choose an do not desire. But if you will share this fate with me, then I will call you brother or sister and join with you against Darkness.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T00:40:23-08:00","id":355524,"title":"","content":"Val sighs. &quot;Man, you've got some issues. Did you listen to nothing I said? You can't make me leave, and who the hell made you cosmic arbiter anyway?&quot;<br /> <br /> He raises his hackles, a growl creeping into his voice. &quot;But seriously though, get the hell out of my.&quot;<br /> <br /> He glances towards Geoff, flicking his ears.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T16:58:10-08:00","id":356104,"title":"","content":"&quot;Enough!&quot; Hannah finally yelled, marching with strong strides, feet kicking snow as she goes. &quot;Scott, stand the fuck down. Val shut the fuck up! None of us even are proper Tribe members yet til this shit is done.&quot; She pushes herself between the bickering Garou. &quot;After this is all said and done we can sort out if we want to be here, all I want to know is this. If we come under attack, if things get hostile, do we have each others backs?&quot; She takes a moment to leer at everyone.<br /> <br /> &quot;I may be a bitch,&quot; she straitens up, looking a little more reflective, &quot;but you <i>are </i>my brothers and sister, and I will die defending any Gaia serving Garou out there. Right now let's just focus on if we're all on that same page, if we are, can we call this case closed til we sort the rite out?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T17:36:09-08:00","id":356115,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will have your back,&quot; Scott says to Hannah, and looks sharply at Val before turning and stalking off without another word.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-03T11:01:56-08:00","id":358416,"title":"","content":"Val's muzzle splits into a languid grin. &quot;I was awaiting your wisdom, memsahib. Obviously I'm not going to let you die, you haven't annoyed me nearly enough, unlike certain other individuals...&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> He sets his jaw. &quot;Don't get your hopes up. I'm not leaving. Ever heard of dharma Zen-boy? And I had no intention of foregoing this rite, but if you expect me not to complain...Come now, I'm a Ragabash, I'm SUPPOSED to complain. Will of Gaia and all that...&quot;<br /> <br /> Rolling his eyes (as best a wolf can), Val bounds over to Geoff. He presses his muzzle close to his ear, whispering.<br /> <br /> &quot;This lot don't need an initiation, they need a bloody padded cell! Still...&quot; He drops his gaze. &quot;Thanks for sticking up for me.&quot; <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-03T17:57:07-08:00","id":358679,"title":"","content":"Geoff narrowed his eyes at Hannah's intervention, and especially at Scott's reaction to it. However, he couldn't help but lean back in surprise when Val whispered in his ear. &quot;Dude, personal space...&quot; He still smiled though, as best as a wolf can. &quot;Don't worry about it&quot;, he answered, not bothering to lower his voice. &quot;As I said, I would have done the same to any of you. I'm the Philodox, I'm supposed to bring this group together.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But come on, let's go...&quot; he said, getting up and trotting in the snow to get the pack going, finally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T00:08:13-08:00","id":358855,"title":"","content":"&quot;Come on you wonderful <i>pazu</i>, <i>chalo</i>.&quot; Val dashes after Geoff, not sparing the rest of the pack a glance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T17:55:20-08:00","id":359754,"title":"","content":"Hannah waited a moment, making sure everyone was keen on not reengaging. After she seemed satisfied she began to walk behind the moving Garou, clearing her throat she let her voice carry, &quot;Good to know we're all on the same page then. I know not all of you are happy with how this is going, but it's not about if we're happy, I don't know if you've all grasped this yet, but you're life is now about survival. Whatever you held dear, whatever made you a person is dead.&quot; She spoke up even louder, &quot;we are soldiers in a struggle for the soul of the very universe. If that has not sunk in, take a moment to let it. Check your egos and individualism at the door please.&quot; She fell silent and shifted back into lupus, following after Stir-of-Echoes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T01:52:35-08:00","id":360018,"title":"","content":"Catching up with Geoff, Val falls in beside him. &quot;Check your egos and individualism at the door?&quot; he whispers, ears flat. &quot;Yikes! Cult zombie alert! It's only a matter of time before memsahib stops calling herself Hannah, and goes with 'Rends-The-Unworthy' or 'Screams-Before-Killing'.&quot;<br /> <br /> Val glances about to ensure the rest of the pack are out of earshot, before fixing his companion with an anxious expression, tail low. <br /> <br /> &quot;Please tell me you don't buy into all this stuff Geoff.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T04:40:51-08:00","id":360109,"title":"","content":"Geoff answered with a low grumble, whispering as well. &quot;She isn't completely wrong, but right now, she's just a bully, and I want to punch her face. I'll talk to her later.&quot; He nudged Val with his muzzle, a wry smile on his face. &quot;So try to not give her or Echoes a reason to get mad at you again, okay? Otherwise, she'll just use them as proof that we're lower than her.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T05:27:53-08:00","id":360135,"title":"","content":"If Echo had heard them (thanks to that whole spiritually enhanced senses deal), she makes nothing of it, and carries on following the trail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T06:48:53-08:00","id":360180,"title":"","content":"Jon puffed out of his jowls, releasing a small cloud of steam into the cold air. He rolled his eyes once again, but then double-timed his run to make sure he kept with the party. He's starting to get accustomed to the four-legged form, as if were the second-nature it's supposed to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T07:36:24-08:00","id":360200,"title":"","content":"Val nudges Geoff back, tail wagging. &quot;Thank Shiva you're not like the rest. Or like the only other Fenrir I know, Odin the Ubermensch, or whatever the hell he's called.&quot;<br /> <br /> He gives a little yip. &quot;See, told you we were gonna be friends.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T13:38:44-08:00","id":360534,"title":"","content":"<br /> With Stir of Echoes in the lead, the party (as calling them a pack doesn't seem appropriate at this point) continues southwards through the forest. The night continues to grow colder, but the sky remains clear of clouds, with no snow threatening. A sharp wind occasionally rustles through the pines, but otherwise the six wolves run on, occasionally hearing the sounds of the forest at night. A hooting owl, a clump of snow falling from a branch...<br /> <br /> When the party is about halfway to their destination, Stir of Echoes, still in the lead, encounters an oddity. The tracks of an adult deer, female by the smell, left within the last twenty minutes at most, heading northwest. Following them, the tracks of two booted humans, one with big feet and a heavy stride, the other smaller and lighter. The tracks come from the direction of the road and are following those of the deer northwest, in a direction that will take them well away from both the sept and the ghost town that the party is headed towards.<br /> <br /> Stir of Echoes, being in the lead, sees the tracks first, but they are not hidden in any way and, in the snow, they are blatantly obvious to everyone else as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-05T23:58:07-08:00","id":361051,"title":"","content":"Echo slid into a stalk midstride, a sudden crimp in her tail indicating for the others to stop, and cut down the path following the tracks. She would pause a few yards in, cocking her head, drinking in every smell and cupping her ears forward.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">a perception roll will appear here shortly<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-06T06:57:25-08:00","id":361264,"title":"","content":"The doe passed this way about twenty minutes ago, the two humans, both male, about five minutes behind it. The doe was not panicked or frightened, by the scent trail she left behind. At least one of the humans was wearing some kind of strong, unnatural fragrance that Echoes can't identify, though it tickles her nose a bit. She can identify one more scent fairly clearly- a faint residue of gunpowder. Not strong enough to indicate the recent discharge of a weapon... on a clear night like this, the party would have heard that anyway... but at least one of the humans is carrying at least one firearm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T02:10:32-08:00","id":362239,"title":"","content":"A single, audible snort escaped Echo as she pulled back from the odor, ears slick against her skull. It was all the motivation she needed to scurry back to the pack.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hunters passed this way, tracking a doe. They have guns, but we could catch them, if we move quickly.&quot; She frowned. &quot;They smell bad.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T04:48:50-08:00","id":362331,"title":"","content":"Val lowers his tail. &quot;Why chase after these hunters? I thought we were heading to the quasi-abandoned sept of the All-Mighty Racoon.&quot;<br /> <br /> He flicks his ears. &quot;They don't smell of...the...uh...Wyrm, do they?&quot; He glances aside. &quot;Because that would be bad.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T05:36:48-08:00","id":362355,"title":"","content":"&quot;No, not like that. I don't know.&quot; Her brows knitted together. &quot;Something about them is off. We could check them out, or carry on. I leave it up to the pack.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T07:18:18-08:00","id":362402,"title":"","content":"Geoff tilted his head. &quot;Why check them out? If they don't smell of Wyrm, they're just two hunters. Sure, it's weird for an human to hunt on New Year's Eve, but frankly, I don't see why we should catch them. Also, I'd prefer to avoid humans with firearms unless it's necessary&quot;. He shook his head to get rid of a bit of snow that had fallen on him earlier. &quot;I'll follow if you want to investigate, as long as you're not needlessly violent toward these guys.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T07:39:30-08:00","id":362411,"title":"","content":"The lean silver wolf stepped up, &quot;we are still very close to the Caerns here, outside of the range of the protectorate perhaps, but still they are encroaching.&quot; She went quiet for a moment and looked at the stars overhead as a look of reverence played on her face, &quot;they're too far away for me to feel any Wyrm on them if I tried, I think,&quot; she added, &quot;still something we should probably look into, we do have a duty to keep these lands unspoiled.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1043-mrmarkers","name":"MrMarkers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1043_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T07:40:42-08:00","id":362413,"title":"","content":"Jon practically skidded to a stop. He examined his surroundings, though it was only cursory. &quot;What? Why are we stopping now? Unless whatever it is is somehow connected with what we have been tasked to do, we should just move on and get this over with. We don't need distractions.&quot; He sighed out, &quot;Hunters. Well fuck us coming and going. Dangerous predators, or punk kids without the orange safety vests.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T06:36:16-08:00","id":363451,"title":"","content":"Scott continues to follow along.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T11:55:53-08:00","id":363724,"title":"","content":"Val glances around at the assembled pack. &quot;Well, now we're all standing here looking stupid, what's the plan?&quot;<br /> <br /> He looks pointedly at Hannah. &quot;You're not exactly Razia Sultana, so let's exercise some democracy. I vote we continue on to the poorly-defined sept slash necropolis and let these smelly hunters get on with their business.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-08T15:05:41-08:00","id":363857,"title":"","content":"Disappointment flashed across her maw. &quot;This is a mistake.&quot;<br /> <br /> She glanced down the trail, then turned and made way for the Sept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-09T00:02:49-08:00","id":364164,"title":"","content":"Val stares, muzzle gaping. &quot;Wow, someone actually <i>listened </i>to me! I feel faint...&quot;<br /> <br /> He looks to Geoff. &quot;So, shall we follow her?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-09T06:23:57-08:00","id":364294,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, yeah. Unless you want to find your own way to the Sept.&quot; Geoff snorted, and he started to follow Echoes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-09T06:54:27-08:00","id":364301,"title":"","content":"&quot;I only meant...&quot; Grinding his teeth, he sighs. &quot;<i>Hayaraba. Purusham</i>.&quot; <br /> <br /> He trails after Geoff and Echoes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-09T23:13:26-08:00","id":365158,"title":"","content":"Jon chuffed exasperatedly. He shook his lupine head but silently followed from then on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T16:15:34-08:00","id":373017,"title":"","content":"Scott follows along with Echoes, unless Hannah makes another decision, and will likely follow her over the lupus if they disagree on their next course of actions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T07:38:28-08:00","id":378045,"title":"","content":"Stir of Echoes led the group south, continuing through the forest towards their intended destination. For almost an hour, the six wolves ran through the woods, stopping only rarely for Echoes to sniff around for a moment and get her bearings. They encountered occasional tracks through the snow, but only what one would expect to find in the Pine Barrens on a snowy night.<br /> <br /> Finally, with the night wearing on, the party had almost arrived at their destination. Just before the village should be coming into sight, however, Stir of Echoes noticed another trail. This one was far different, not human at all, and she noticed it by scent first. Wolf prints through the snow, perhaps 3 hours old, give or take. THey were from a single wolf, an adult, though not a large one. They seemed to be a curving trail and, if it followed the same trail all the way, the wolf had circled the village.<br /> <br /> There was something else odd about the tracks, but Echoes couldn't quite put her finger on what.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T03:13:06-08:00","id":378869,"title":"","content":"Again, she would come to a stop, facing her fellows.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Sept is just up ahead, but there's something else here. Come, smell.&quot; Echo sniffed at the trail. &quot;These are wolf tracks. Not very old. Seem to circle the territory. Bone Gnawers keeping watch?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T06:00:43-08:00","id":378954,"title":"","content":"Geoff did as he was told and sniffed the trail as well, but it was obvious to a Lupus' eyes that he wasn't doing it properly. Still, he answered her. &quot;Or maybe not. Maybe it's something else, something... worse.&quot; He paused, as he instinctively flashed his fangs at the trail. &quot;I say we check it out. And even if it's Bone Gnawers tracks, at least we could introduce ourselves before we enter their territory, even if it's to save it. No harm done.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T09:09:26-08:00","id":379073,"title":"","content":"As Geoff smelled the tracks, his lupus nose confirmed that, yes, it was a wolf, and yes, it did pass this way sometime within the lest few hours.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">OOC: Sorry for the very undescriptive post, but this is the result of the Per+Alert roll I just made for Geoff, since he went up and at least tried to sniff at the trail.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1416,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","user":"NutiketAiel","date":".  Tense 01-23-2015, 12:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T09:12:36-08:00","id":379074,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't get it. The tracks go in a circle and then what? Do they head towards the village, or away from it?&quot; Val lowers his tail. &quot;Something's...off&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T22:39:06-08:00","id":379863,"title":"","content":"Jon stopped nearby, ears splaying. He wasn't sure what to do, but he gave a token sniff, &quot;Strange... I think.&quot; He lifted his head and smirked to Val, whispering, &quot;Y'think? What hasn't been off this whole night?&quot; After that touch of snark, Jon silenced himself, jaws clenching as he examined the area.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4123,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","user":"Rall Bashir","date":".  Got rid of extranneous Hs. 01-24-2015, 04:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-23T22:45:50-08:00","id":379866,"title":"","content":"John's cursory sniff revealed that the tracks in the snow... smelled like snow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-24T09:25:57-08:00","id":380227,"title":"","content":"Echo snorted. &quot;I don't know, Val, I can't see through the brush.&quot;<br /> <br /> She started up the trail, looking to whoever came by her side (if anyone followed at all, that is). &quot;There <i>is </i>something strange about this scent. Maybe we should spread out and stalk, stay hidden.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-24T11:27:49-08:00","id":380309,"title":"","content":"&quot;Let's go together.&quot; Geoff said as he came to her side. &quot;Some of us aren't really used to their wolf senses, and it'll be easy to lose their way. You're a better tracker than us, we'll follow you.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T04:41:38-08:00","id":380910,"title":"","content":"&quot;She can tell the trail goes in a circle but nothing more than that. Ha. What powers of perception.&quot; Val sidles up to Echoes. &quot;Try not to lead us to our doom.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T09:56:48-08:00","id":382117,"title":"","content":"Jon's face had an exhausted expression on his face. He gave a quiet nod of assent towards Geoff, &quot;Wiser move. United we stand, et cetera.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T16:23:03-08:00","id":383762,"title":"","content":"Scott has still been quiet, but is willing to trust in Echoes' senses and follows her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T18:04:58-08:00","id":383854,"title":"","content":"As the team followed along the trail, it became obvious that the wolf did indeed circle around the village. They followed the trail almost three quarters of the way around the village before finding a change.<br /> <br /> Southeast of the village, the team finds where the tracks circle around back to their beginning. Three wolves approached the village from the southwest, perhaps four hours ago. One of them circled around the village, making the tracks that the party has been following; the other two continued on to the village. When the circling wolf returned to the starting point, it turned and followed the tracks of the other two into the village. There are no apparent tracks leading out of the village.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T19:18:19-08:00","id":384708,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't like this,&quot; Geoff said in a snarl.&quot;We should be prepared for anything, maybe an ambush... Let's stay close, okay?&quot; He advanced toward the village, trying to get the pack on the move.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T06:12:22-08:00","id":384936,"title":"","content":"Hackles up, she flashed her teeth, but said nothing, moving alongside Geoff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T05:22:01-08:00","id":386183,"title":"","content":"&quot;If we all die, can I say 'told you so'?&quot; Val says, trailing after Echoes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T19:39:18-08:00","id":386942,"title":"","content":"&quot;Isn't that why you're here?&quot; Geoff teased with a grin. &quot;Okay, there might other garou here, but remember everyone, we're primarily looking for banes. I don't... really know what they're supposed to look like though, never seen one.&quot; He mused in a low voice ad he trotted with the pack. &quot;Echoes, you're our Theurge, right? What can you tell us about them?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T22:45:56-08:00","id":387073,"title":"","content":"Jon stopped when everyone else stopped. He tilted his muzzle down and looked up at everyone. This gave him a grumpy expression. Jon kept quiet, however.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T00:23:58-08:00","id":387145,"title":"","content":"&quot;Something wrong Jon?&quot; You look like an abandoned puppy trying to get adopted.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T01:16:03-08:00","id":387159,"title":"","content":"Jon's ears perked right up, &quot;Hmm? Oh, nothing at all. In the past ten minutes I've come to accept and embrace my eventual death, here.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T08:32:30-08:00","id":389886,"title":"","content":"Scott continues to remain quiet, just waiting, watching, and listening while he goes along with his prospective pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3789-deathmatchfm","name":"DeathmatchFM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T22:43:31-08:00","id":391060,"title":"","content":"&quot;They're of the Wyrm. Corrupt, unnatural spirits that feed off despair, misery, loathing, things of the human mind and worse. Parasites.&quot; There was a bit of a drone to her voice, as if she was reciting from memory. &quot;Kill them, find the source, and cleanse the the land.&quot; She side eyed her less than thrilled packmates. &quot;If our Galliard and Ragabash keep up their whines, they'll be drawn to us in no time.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Now. We hunt the source. Human activity, old talens, anything suspicious. Watch for that raccoon spirit, too, and for water or reflections - I'll need one to carry us into the Penumbra.&quot; Here, she paused, facing them with a grim expression. &quot;When we cross over, do not separate from the pack. The spirit wilds are vast, and it is easy to get lost, and even easier to die.&quot;<br /> <br /> She'd wait for any further questions. If none came, she continued towards the village.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u>Rage Across the Delaware Valley</u><br /> <b>Health: </b><br /> <b>Rage (3)</b>:<br /> <b>Gnosis (7):</b> X<br /> <b>Willpower (6): </b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3804-stir-of-echoes","name":"Stir of Echoes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T07:02:54-08:00","id":391363,"title":"","content":"&quot;Whine? Me? Madam you wound me.&quot; He dips his muzzle closer to Jon, whispering. &quot;Funny, I heard Banes are given life through pain and suffering, so I don't know how violence could ever get rid of them. Although I suppose you don't know much about Banes, do you Barbie boy?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T09:42:29-08:00","id":391559,"title":"","content":"Geoff nodded and smiled. &quot;Thank you, Echoes. Okay everyone, you heard her. We're looking for racoons, reflections. but mostly suspicious activities. Oh, and those three wolves too. Now, let's keep the talking at a minimum, shall we? Otherwise they'll get the drop on us in no time,&quot; he said calmly, not wanting to sound like he was giving them orders. Then he followed Echoes toward the village.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T11:13:18-08:00","id":392742,"title":"","content":"Jon rolled his eyes, &quot;Don't know much about banes other than what's been sung to me.&quot; He gave a nod of assent to Echoes, &quot;But remember... there are two Galliards.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4123-rall-bashir","name":"Rall Bashir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T08:03:33-08:00","id":393741,"title":"","content":"Val smiles. &quot;Of course. I'm sure this will be a...fascinating experience.&quot; Padding past Jon, he flicks his tail at him, following Geoff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3869-al-haleem","name":"Al-Haleem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3869_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-06T12:18:54-08:00","id":395250,"title":"","content":"As the team followed the trail, they reached the outskirts of the village. Besides the wolfish footprints they were following, there was no indication of habitation. The buildings, though covered in snow, were obviously quite old (well, at least by American standards), and are showing signs of neglect. Most of them are single story homes of wooden construction, though in the distance on the far side of the village the cubs can see the outline of a few taller buildings. There is little to indicate that this was a place of the Garou, though there are a few unobtrusive signs visible to the observant. The Gaia glyph carved into a doorframe here, the tribal symbol of the Bone Gnawers etched on a stone, Rat's glyph burned into a fence post...<br /> <br /> There appeared to be a larger, three story structure at the center of the village, but the tracks that the cubs were following didn't go that way. Instead, they curved, following a path towards the northeastern edge of the village. The three sets of footprints did not deviate- they did not appear to be traveling around the village or exploring- they were going to a specific destination. After they passed the first few houses, the first two sets of tracks changed, and the cubs could see the progression of pawprints, clawprints and footprints as the wolves worked through the five forms from lupus to homid. The prints of the wolf that circled the village remained the same, following the other two. Both sets of human prints were wearing boots, though one appeared to be male, the other felame, by the shape and size of the prints.<br /> <br /> As they approached the northeastern edge of the village, the cubs started to hear something- an occasional clang of metal, echoing off the walls of the houses. Metal hitting dirt or ice, metal hitting stone... it seemed to reverberate from the direction the tracks are heading, though they curve around another building ahead and the cubs can't see where they end up. They also hear what sound like voices, speaking, though they are too muffled to make out what they are saying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1416-nutiketaiel","name":"NutiketAiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1416_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T16:07:04-08:00","id":396883,"title":"","content":"Teeth bared, she dropped into a crouch and began to creep towards the sounds, sticking to the shadows and to the sides of buildings in an attempt to remain unseen.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input typ